&lt;div&gt;The balance of "Other Income"&amp;nbsp; for the quarter ended June 30, 2022 shows a negative balance primarily on account of foreign exchange loss amounting to Rs. 165.24 million incurred during the quarter.&lt;/div&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/br&gt; 
